    "ContentType": "html",
    "Content": "<p>We&#39;ve added initial support for using Azure App Service Authentication/Authorization (also know as Easy Auth) with Azure Active Directory B2C policies.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>For more information, see the <a href=\"https://blogs.msdn.microsoft.com/appserviceteam/2016/06/22/app-service-auth-and-azure-ad-b2c/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">detailed blog post</a>.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n",
    "Markdown": "We've added initial support for using Azure App Service Authentication/Authorization (also know as Easy Auth) with Azure Active Directory B2C policies.\n\nFor more information, see the detailed blog post ."
